{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06451","headline":"龙门送裴侍御监五岭选 · 李颀","name":"龙门送裴侍御监五岭选","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"万里番禺地，官人继帝忧。\n君爲柱下史，将命出东周。\n歇马傍川路，张灯临石楼。\n棱棱静疎木，濞濞响寒流。\n榔叶四荒外，梅花五岭头。\n明珠尉佗国，翠羽夜郎洲。\n夷俗富珍产，土风资宦游。\n心清物不杂，弊革事无留。\n举善必称最，持奸当去尤。\n何辞桂江远，今日用贤秋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06451.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06451","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}